OL,3,GUK long range forecast
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thu 8 Oct to Thu 22 Oct
OL,6,FInitially, high pressure centred to
OL,7,Fthe north or northeast, with longer
OL,8,Fdrier periods likely across northern
OL,9,FUK, whilst low pressure to the
OL,10,Fsouthwest brings occasional rain or
OL,11,Fshowers into more southern and western
OL,12,Fparts. Towards and beyond mid-October,
OL,13,Fit may turn more widely unsettled with
OL,14,Fa greater chance of wet and windy
OL,15,Fconditions at times. Temperatures will
OL,16,Flikely be above average for the period
OL,17,Fas a whole.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
